    "snowbird": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-29 05:44:01",
      "note": "Gooooood morning Snowbird! It’s Owen, with your snow report for Sunday. Mountain Update: 8 am - 2 pm spring lift operations will remain in place through Monday, March 30. Hours of operation will be reassessed early in the week based on temperatures. . It’s Sunday-Funday people. Surf Season is alive and well at The Bird and it’s going to be yet another beautiful day up here. Today’s forecast calls for, you guessed it, sunny skies and a high of around 61°. This won’t last forever however, because believe it or not, this week, mother nature might be bringing snow. Let’s all hope that it shows up and breathes some new life into this snowpack. This weekend marks the start of Plazapalooza . The Tram Deck is the place to be from 1–4pm with live music from The Alpines. Hang out, cop some sweet Surf Season swag, and aprés like you don't have to go back to work tomorrow. Please note, due to current operating hours, Plazapalooza will run from 1-4pm this weekend only. If you haven't yet gotten your Chickadee Fever badge on the Snowbird App, now is the time! The Chickadee Lift will close for the 2025-26 season for replacement on April 6th. The new Chickadee Lift is expected to reopen for summer operations in July. ALL uphill travel is closed. Don’t be that guy (or gal). Please remember to ski and ride in control, if you don’t, you’re gonna have a bad time. It's Surf Season, so to quote that one guy, \"drop in, just smack the lip, wapow.\" Go get pitted y'all. #GTMB",
